":4957328563,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ3rUsw","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:12:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T11:12:56Z","body":"> There is nothing buggy here. You are trying to do something that is not supported. You cannot bind the same texture as both an `image2D` and a `sampler2D`, as the error already tells you.\n\nSo what you want to say is that the crash in the release build of the engine is a completely normal thing to expect? And you can't expect the engine to tell you what the problem is if you use the release build of it which is distributed by default?\n\nAnd also that's not true that it's not supported because it works fine in debug build it just spams the error.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957328563/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957349253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121271#issuecomment-4957349253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121271","id":4957349253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ3slhQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:14:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T11:14:51Z","body":"There's sections of the engine that has dev only checks and errors for performance and where release code doesn't check assuming the project has been debugged and errors resolved in the development process","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957349253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957405256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121271#issuecomment-4957405256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121271","id":4957405256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ3wASA","user":{"login":"romgerman","id":1517367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTczNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1517367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman","html_url":"https://github.com/romgerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/romgerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:22:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T11:22:11Z","body":"> assuming the project has been debugged\n\nAre are saying that I should debug the engine code and not my project's code? Because again if you read carefuly I write that the error spam exists only in the debug version of the engine and the error spam doesn't prevent the \"unsupported\" thing to work correctly (which I write about here https://github.com/DevPrice/godot-slang/issues/25#issuecomment-4950790801). But Godot doesn't distribute the debug version by default so you cannot simply know what the problem is because you get a crash without any specific error logged, you do not get the error spam which I repeat again exists only in the debug version. And until you compile the engine yourself you cannot know why the crash is happening. I personally don't think that hiding the cause of the crash is a good thing to have in a general purpose engine because it's very confusing for the end user.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957405256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957421919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121271#issuecomment-4957421919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121271","id":4957421919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ3xBXw","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T11:24:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T13:01:20Z","body":"> So what you want to say is that the crash in the release build of the engine is a completely normal thing to expect? And you can't expect the engine to tell you what the problem is if you use the release build of it which is distributed by default?\n\nThe checks appear to be behind DEV_ENABLED, not sure why they are. Ideally this should be reported on release, yes.\n\n> And also that's not true that it's not supported because it works fine in debug build it just spams the error.\n\nIt works \"fine\" by complete luck on your system configuration. This is incorrect behavior on both D3D12 and Vulkan and might break on other systems. I'm fairly certain with Vulkan GPU validation enabled, you are going to see errors get printed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957421919/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4957433272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121271#issuecomment-4957433272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121271","id":4957433272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ3xtuA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/priva